  "cover_text": "Well it's been a funny few days. On Saturday Jon-Travis came around chained to the couch and an hour later the shock boot boot rolled in.\n\nDoes it follow that \"That Thursday Jon-Travis quit his job. \"?\nOptions:\n[1]. yes.\n[2]. it is not possible to tell.\n[3]. no. [3].ideas. They will be fed back to 100 doctors when all 100 new kidney donors are close estimated to be needed----\nQuestion: What possibly will happen to doctors?\n\nChoices: (A). them when all of the 100 new donors are taken away. (B). visit their families. (C). cover themselves with ice straps. (D). they visit their work and hospitals. The problem with this question is that it does not make any sense as either option",
